#: jpegger/simple_appcontext.py:217
msgid ""
"Jpegger是一个简单的批量转换图片的命令行工具。\n"
"\n"
"            使用选项可以简单地控制输出图片的尺寸、编码质量和色彩空间。\n"
"            本工具旨在快速地进行简单的批量处理，所以暂不提供更高级的客制化功能。\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Jpegger is a simple command-line tool for batch image conversion.\n"
"\n"
"            Options control output image dimensions, encoding quality, "
"and color space.\n"
"            This tool is designed for quick, simple batch processing, so "
"advanced customization is not available.\n"
"            "

